## ⚙️ Setup Instructions  

```bash
# 1️⃣ Create Virtual Environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # (Linux/Mac)
venv\Scripts\activate      # (Windows)

# 2️⃣ Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

🏋️‍♂️ Training the Model
python train_model.py

✅ Downloads MNIST dataset
✅ Trains a CNN model
✅ Saves model as mnist_cnn.h5

🖥 Run the GUI
python gui_predict.py

🖌 Draw a digit with mouse
🔮 Press Predict → see the model output instantly

📌 Notes & Improvements

✨ Train with more epochs for better accuracy
✨ Add data augmentation to improve generalization
✨ Use OpenCV webcam input:

Capture frame → Grayscale → Resize (28×28) → Predict

✨ Export model:

. TensorFlow SavedModel
. TensorFlow Lite (TFLite) for mobile deployment

